{"id":13647,"artist":"G.B. Pergolesi","title":"Se tu m'ami","lyrics_plain":null,"lyrics_synced":"[00:08.27] Se tu m'a mi, se tu so spi ri,\n[00:15.51] Sol per me gen til pa stor.\n[00:23.94] Ho do lor de' tuoi mar ti ri,\n[00:27.98] Ho di let to del tuo a mor,\n[00:32.01] Ma se pen si che so let to\n[00:36.67] Io ti deb ba ri a mar,\n[00:43.20] Pas to rel lo, sei sog get to\n[00:47.64] Fa cil men te a t'in gan nar;\n[00:52.09] Pas to rel lo, sei sog get to\n[00:56.53] Fa cil men te a t'in gan nar;\n[01:00.97] Fa cil men te a t'in gan nar.\n[01:05.42] Bel la ro sa por po ri na\n[01:09.86] Og gi Sil via sce glie rà,\n[01:14.31] Con la scu sa del la spi na\n[01:18.75] Do man poi la sprez ze rà,\n[01:23.20] Do man poi la sprez ze rà,\n[01:27.68] Ma de gli u omi ni il con si glio\n[01:32.44] Io per me non se gui rò.\n[01:37.13] Non per ché mi pia ce il gi glio\n[01:41.36] Gli al tri fio ri sprez ze rò.\n[01:59.98] Se tu m'a mi, se tu so spi ri,\n[02:07.29] Sol per me gen til pa stor.\n[02:12.50] Ho do lor de' tuoi mar ti ri,\n[02:16.68] Ho di let to del tuo a mor,\n[02:20.85] Ma se pen si che so let to\n[02:25.03] Io ti deb ba ri a mar,\n[02:29.20] Pas to rel lo, sei sog get to\n[02:33.37] Fa cil men te a t'in gan nar;\n[02:37.55] Pas to rel lo, sei sog get to\n[02:42.69] Fa cil men te a t'in gan nar;\n[02:47.97] Fa cil men te a t'in gan nar.\n","lyrics_synced_enhanced":"[00:00.00] <00:00.00>  <00:00.00>  <00:00.00>  <00:00.00>  <00:00.00>  <00:00.00>  <00:00.00>  <00:00.00>  <00:00.11> Soprano\n[00:08.27] <00:08.27> Se <00:08.27> Se <00:08.27> If.you.love.me,.if.you.sigh\n[00:09.30] <00:09.30> tu <00:09.30> tu <00:10.33> m'a <00:10.33> m'a <00:11.37> mi, <00:11.37> mi, <00:12.40> se <00:12.40> se <00:12.92> tu <00:12.92> tu <00:13.95> so <00:13.95> so <00:14.47> spi <00:14.47> spi <00:14.99> ri, <00:14.99> ri,\n[00:15.46] <00:15.46> Only.for.me,.dear.shepherd,\n[00:15.50] <00:15.50> Sol <00:15.50> Sol <00:16.02> per <00:16.02> per <00:16.59> me <00:16.59> me <00:17.23> 